flipt

This plugin was ported from the Civitai Flipt feature-flag skill and adapted for the gopher-skills
marketplace (Claude-compatible SKILL.md frontmatter; added .claude-plugin/plugin.json and
package.json; genericized Civitai-specific defaults). The upstream content is licensed under
Apache-2.0.

Upstream source:
  civitai/civitai — .claude/skills/flipt
  https://github.com/civitai/civitai/tree/main/.claude/skills/flipt

Files ported/adapted from this source:
  skills/flipt/flipt.mjs        (ported with two genericizations: projectRoot now resolves to
                                  process.cwd() instead of a hardcoded ../../.. Civitai path, and
                                  the usage-comment paths updated; logic otherwise verbatim)
  skills/flipt/.env.example     (defaults genericized: FLIPT_URL -> http://localhost:8080,
                                  FLIPT_STATE_REPO -> a placeholder org)
  skills/flipt/SKILL.md         (rewritten for a generic Flipt instance: Claude Code frontmatter,
                                  a concepts overview, genericized command paths, and a
                                  non-Civitai-specific GitOps section; command/option reference
                                  preserved from upstream)

Civitai-specific assumptions removed:
  - Hardcoded FLIPT_URL default (flipt.civitai.com) -> localhost:8080
  - Hardcoded GitOps state repo (civitai/flipt-state) -> generic <your-org>/flipt-state
  - Env-file path relative to Civitai's repo layout -> process.cwd()

Optional companion (not bundled):
  flipt-io/mcp-server-flipt (Apache-2.0) — the official Flipt MCP server, which exposes the same
  flag/segment/rule/rollout/evaluation surface to Claude Code. This plugin ships the script-based
  helper instead of the MCP runtime.

